 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the luncheon meat into <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> thick slices</b> and the frankfurters on the diagonal into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> pieces. Chop the kimchi into bite-sized pieces.</li><li>Cut the ends off the onion, halve it and slice it lengthwise. Cut the tofu into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> slices, the mushrooms into halves and the spring onions into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 cm</span> lengths.</li><li>Stir the gochujang, soy sauce, minced garlic, mirin, sugar and pepper into a thick paste. For a spicier pot, add the gochugaru.</li></ul>",
