   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Spread the onion over the bottom of the cold pan. On top, arrange the luncheon meat, frankfurters, kimchi, tofu and mushrooms in <b>separate sections</b> around the pan.</li><li>Spoon the baked beans and the minced beef into gaps. Put the sauce paste as one dollop in the centre.</li></ul>",
