  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour the stock gently down the side of the pan until the ingredients are about two-thirds covered.</li><li>Cover and bring to a boil on <b>medium-high</b>, then cook for <b>5 minutes</b>. Uncover, stir the sauce paste into the broth and break up the minced beef. Simmer for another <b>3 minutes</b> and taste; add a splash of soy sauce if it needs more salt.</li></ul>",
