  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the ramen block in the centre and lay the cheese slice on top of it. Scatter the spring onions around.</li><li>Simmer for <b>2–3 minutes</b>, loosening the noodles with chopsticks once they soften, until they are just cooked and the cheese has melted into the broth. Serve straight from the pan; the noodles keep softening.</li></ul>",
